From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Claude Opus 5.5" <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 11:38:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 28/39] Linux package: Ibasho's names and licences

The Linux package starts with an ibasho-viewer script (bin/ibasho-viewer-bin
is the viewer itself), without Linden Lab's install script, desktop menu
entries and secondlife:// handler, which would install the viewer as
"Second Life". build_data.json names the binary.

licenses-linux.txt is the Windows list as Ibasho audited it, plus SDL3
(zlib license) and the Linux OpenAL Soft and freealut libraries, which are
LGPL, with where their source is.
---
