 indra/newview/licenses-linux.txt           | 382 ++++++++++-----------
 indra/newview/linux_tools/ibasho-viewer.sh |   8 +
 indra/newview/viewer_manifest.py           |  24 +-
 4 files changed, 201 insertions(+), 222 deletions(-)
 create mode 100755 indra/newview/linux_tools/ibasho-viewer.sh

